# Raven's examples/headless/music.script, for this port: widgets found by their names, as in the
# original (collection.title, search.query), and by what they read. The songs of this library are
# not those of the C one, so the search looks for one of its own.
#
#   bun run smoke

click "text:Focus flow"
expect collection.title text "Focus flow"

click search.query
type "Static"
key Enter
settle 1
expect "text:Static Lanterns" shown
mark searched
